w-wrap: break-word;\"><p data-identifyelement=\"1170\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 0pt 20px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.38; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"1171\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">State</span></p></td></tr><tr data-identifyelement=\"1172\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; user-select: none; height: 0pt;\"><td data-identifyelement=\"1173\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 5pt; min-width: 5px; cursor: text; font-size: 13px; border: 1pt solid rgb(0, 0, 0); user-select: text; overflow: hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p data-identifyelement=\"1174\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 0pt 20px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.38; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"1175\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">Postal code</span></p></td></tr><tr data-identifyelement=\"1176\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; user-select: none; height: 0pt;\"><td data-identifyelement=\"1177\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 5pt; min-width: 5px; cursor: text; font-size: 13px; border: 1pt solid rgb(0, 0, 0); user-select: text; overflow: hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p data-identifyelement=\"1178\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 0pt 20px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.38; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"1179\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">Website</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><hr style=\"box-sizing: content-box; border-width: 1px 0px 0px; border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: initial; border-bottom-style: initial; border-left-style: initial; border-top-color: rgb(238, 238, 238); border-right-color: initial; border-bottom-color: initial; border-left-color: initial; border-image: initial; height: 0px; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px; user-select: none; clear: both; break-after: page;\" data-identifyelement=\"1180\"><h2 data-identifyelement=\"1181\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: inherit; font-weight: 400; line-height: 35px; color: inherit; margin: 0px; font-size: 1.5em;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"1182\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Limitations and Expected Behavior:</strong></h2><p data-identifyelement=\"1183\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 0px 20px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\" data-identifyelement=\"1184\">The setting feature is only available for admin users (agency &amp; sub-account). Team&nbsp;</p><p data-identifyelement=\"1185\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 0px 20px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">members with the<strong data-identifyelement=\"1186\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">&nbsp;User Role</strong> will not have the ability to begin the migration process.</p><p data-identifyelement=\"1187\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"1188\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</strong></p><p data-identifyelement=\"1189\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"1190\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Please Note:</strong></p><pre class=\"fd-callout fd-callout--note\" data-identifyelement=\"1191\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; overflow: visible; font-family: monospace, monospace; font-size: 1em; white-space: pre-wrap; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: normal;  margin: 0px 0px 0px 20px; padding: 12px 16px; border-width: 1px 1px 1px 6px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(235, 237, 240) rgb(235, 237, 240) rgb(235, 237, 240) rgb(232, 111, 37); border-image: initial; border-radius: 8px 4px 4px 8px;\">Users with User Role will still see the setting, they just would not be able to do anything to it.</pre><p data-identifyelement=\"1192\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 0px 20px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\" data-identifyelement=\"1193\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\" data-identifyelement=\"1194\">Once the automation settings are turned on, it will migrate all the existing contacts&nbsp;</p><p data-identifyelement=\"1195\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 0px 20px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">with business name. Once the migration is completed, it will automatically sync new</p><p data-identifyelement=\"1196\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 0px 20px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">contacts with business name field value.<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\" data-identifyelement=\"1197\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\" data-identifyelement=\"1198\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"1199\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 0px 20px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">If a contact has a company associated with it already, it will not be migrated to a different company even if the Business Name is different at the time when the process is started. The migration for existing contacts can only happen if the contact doesn\u2019t have any association with a company.</p><p data-identifyelement=\"1200\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 0px 20px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\" data-identifyelement=\"1201\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"1202\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 0px 20px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"1203\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">&nbsp;Please Note:</strong></p><pre class=\"fd-callout fd-callout--note\" data-identifyelement=\"1204\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; overflow: visible; font-family: monospace, monospace; font-size: 1em; white-space: pre-wrap; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: normal;  margin: 0px 0px 0px 20px; padding: 12px 16px; border-width: 1px 1px 1px 6px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(235, 237, 240) rgb(235, 237, 240) rgb(235, 237, 240) rgb(232, 111, 37); border-image: initial; border-radius: 8px 4px 4px 8px;\">Changing the Business Name for contacts already added to a Company will have no impact on the Automation.</pre><p data-identifyelement=\"1205\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\" data-identifyelement=\"1206\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"1207\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 0px 20px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\" data-identifyelement=\"1208\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"1209\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 0px 20px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">If the automation settings are turned off, the auto sync or the migration will stop. Upon turning on the migration or auto sync will begin.&nbsp;</p><p data-identifyelement=\"1210\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 0px 20px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\" data-identifyelement=\"1211\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"1212\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 0px 20px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">The following Audit logs for all the activities are present for this feature.</p><ul data-identifyelement=\"1213\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 8px 0px 4px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; line-height: 17px; list-style: disc;\"><li data-identifyelement=\"1214\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; margin: 0px 0px 0px 20px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Who is the User who initiated the settings option.</li><li data-identifyelement=\"1215\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; margin: 0px 0px 0px 20px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Which Contact got updated with company association.</li><li data-identifyelement=\"1216\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; margin: 0px 0px 0px 20px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Company creation.</li><li data-identifyelement=\"1217\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; margin: 0px 0px 0px 20px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Company update.</li></ul><p data-identifyelement=\"1218\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 0px 20px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">If the settings are turned off in between existing contact migration and restarted, it will start the migration process from where it stopped and complete for the remaining contacts.</p><p data-identifyelement=\"1219\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 0px 20px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\" data-identifyelement=\"1220\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"1221\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 0px 20px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">The feature is applicable for contacts added by bulk import, public API, forms, etc. It will live sync between business name and company.</p><p data-identifyelement=\"1222\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 0px 20px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\" data-identifyelement=\"1223\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"1224\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 0px 20px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"1225\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Please Note:</strong></p><pre class=\"fd-callout fd-callout--note\" data-identifyelement=\"1226\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; overflow: visible; font-family: monospace, monospace; font-size: 1em; white-space: pre-wrap; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: normal;  margin: 0px 0px 0px 20px; padding: 12px 16px; border-width: 1px 1px 1px 6px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(235, 237, 240) rgb(235, 237, 240) rgb(235, 237, 240) rgb(232, 111, 37); border-image: initial; border-radius: 8px 4px 4px 8px;\">The CSV file being imported must have a column with the Column Header \"Business Name\", and the respective Business Names must be filled out for contacts for the contacts to get added into a company upon being imported into the CRM. (Provided that the Company Object Automation is enabled). <br data-identifyelement=\"1227\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1228\">If you make any errors during the import and the wrong Company gets associated to the contacts with misspelled Business Name or spacing in the Business Name that does not match the Business Name for the Company, then you will need to delete the contacts that have the issue and re-import the CSV with the correct Business Name.(<strong data-identifyelement=\"1229\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Any data lost due to the deletion will not be recovered because the contact is not being restored, a new version of the contact is being created)</strong></pre><p data-identifyelement=\"1230\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 0px 20px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\" data-identifyelement=\"1231\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"1232\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 0px 20px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\" data-identifyelement=\"1233\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"1234\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 0px 20px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">This process doesn\u2019t have backward compatibility. Once a company is created based on the business name, any change in the company name or its details doesn\u2019t reflect back on the <strong data-identifyelement=\"1235\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Business Name</strong> field and other synced fields in the contact's <strong data-identifyelement=\"1236\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">General Info</strong>.</p><p data-identifyelement=\"1237\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 0px 20px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">This doesn\u2019t support business name update functionality. Which means once a company is created using business name, any update in business name will not affect the company attributes or its relation with the contact.&nbsp;</p><p data-identifyelement=\"1238\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 0px 20px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\" data-identifyelement=\"1239\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"1240\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 0px 20px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"1241\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Please Note:</strong></p><pre class=\"fd-callout fd-callout--note\" data-identifyelement=\"1242\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; overflow: visible; font-family: monospace, monospace; font-size: 1em; white-space: pre-wrap; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: normal;  margin: 0px 0px 0px 20px; padding: 12px 16px; border-width: 1px 1px 1px 6px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(235, 237, 240) rgb(235, 237, 240) rgb(235, 237, 240) rgb(232, 111, 37); border-image: initial; border-radius: 8px 4px 4px 8px;\">The Company Object automation only serves to associate existing or new contacts, THAT ARE NOT LINKED TO A COMPANY ALREADY, with Companies that share the same <strong data-identifyelement=\"1243\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Business Name</strong>. If no such company exists then a company with that Business Name will be created.</pre></span></div>\n\t"}, {"slug": "155000006891-share-email-template-across-agencies", "title": "Benefits:", "folder": "Templates", "images": ["../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155057354862/original/ASPwv5h6pykU_piiNxcna0bkzpI-9rIZAQ3c6e.jpg?1761975878", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155057354861/original/-R-u91NX8njzSY3XBMEDMQVbLmKBMN1Nng3c6e.jpg?1761975878", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155057354852/original/EpSlYJsOrtBG2Dd_tLdJZDHhKf5EEKzDlwe7da.jpg?1761975864", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155057354859/original/TZy3rQbsdj9xTDxAYE1VwaTg1Z0zRKkULAcdee.jpg?1761975877", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155057354860/original/IxycQixim79mwi5uGfKZz-PlsMz7vgHmwAcdee.jpg?1761975877"], "videos": [], "content": "\n\t\t<div class=\"line\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; border: 0px; margin-bottom: 15px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; display: block; color: rgb(32, 32, 32); font-family: Inter, sans-serif;\">This feature allows agency admins to easily share and manage email templates using a simple link. Follow this guide below to learn how to share templates and socialise to build an ecosystem of well performing emails.</div><p class=\"fd-toc\"><strong>TABLE OF CONTENTS</strong></p><ul><li><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#Benefits%3A\">Benefits</a></li><li><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#How-to-Use%3A\">How to Use</a></li></ul><p><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><div class=\"line\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; border: 0px; margin-bottom: 15px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; display: block; color: rgb(32, 32, 32); font-family: Inter, sans-serif;\"><h2 class=\"bold\" id=\"Benefits:\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.4; border: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; display: inline; font-weight: 700;\">Benefits:<